{"seq":2,"slug":"mcp-server","title":"实现 MCP Server","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-handbook/mcp-protocol/mcp-server","wordCount":923,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"实现-mcp-server\">实现 MCP Server</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>MCP Server 是一个独立进程，通过 MCP 协议对外暴露能力。它把「工具的实现」从 Agent 应用里剥离出来：Server 只负责定义和执行业务逻辑，Agent 侧通过标准协议连接即可使用，双方不必共享语言和进程。</p>\n<p>一个 Server 对外提供三种东西，恰好对应 MCP 的三大原语：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>工具（Tools）</strong>：可被模型主动调用的操作，会改变状态，如 <code>writeFile</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>资源（Resources）</strong>：被动读取的只读数据，如配置文件内容，通过 URI 寻址。</li>\n<li><strong>提示模板（Prompts）</strong>：预定义的交互流程，由用户显式选择。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>本节的落点</th>\n<th>关键 API</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>能力声明</td>\n<td>注册工具与资源</td>\n<td><code>server.tool()</code> / <code>server.resource()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传输方式</td>\n<td>本地 stdio 或远程 Streamable HTTP</td>\n<td><code>StdioServerTransport</code> / <code>StreamableHTTPServerTransport</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全边界</td>\n<td>路径沙箱 + 远程鉴权 + HTTPS</td>\n<td><code>safePath()</code> / OAuth 2.1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实现的骨架很短：用 <code>McpServer</code> 建实例、注册若干工具与资源、挂上传输层并 <code>connect()</code>。真正需要下功夫的是两处安全细节——文件类工具必须做路径校验防止越界，远程暴露必须启用 OAuth 2.1 而非自造鉴权。这两点在本节的代码与反模式里都会具体展开。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"server-架构概览\">Server 架构概览</h2><p>MCP Server 是一个独立运行的进程，通过 MCP 协议向 Client 暴露工具、资源和提示模板。使用 <code>@modelcontextprotocol/sdk</code> 可以快速构建 TypeScript MCP Server。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    SERVER[&quot;MCP Server 进程&quot;]&#10;    SERVER --&gt; TRANSPORT[&quot;Transport 传输层&quot;]&#10;    SERVER --&gt; TOOLS[&quot;Tool 注册&quot;]&#10;    SERVER --&gt; RESOURCES[&quot;Resource 暴露&quot;]&#10;    TRANSPORT --&gt; STDIO[&quot;StdioServerTransport&quot;]&#10;    TRANSPORT --&gt; HTTP[&quot;Streamable HTTP Transport&quot;]&#10;    TOOLS --&gt; T1[&quot;readFile&quot;]&#10;    TOOLS --&gt; T2[&quot;writeFile&quot;]&#10;    TOOLS --&gt; T3[&quot;listFiles&quot;]\">graph TD\n    SERVER[\"MCP Server 进程\"]\n    SERVER --&gt; TRANSPORT[\"Transport 传输层\"]\n    SERVER --&gt; TOOLS[\"Tool 注册\"]\n    SERVER --&gt; RESOURCES[\"Resource 暴露\"]\n    TRANSPORT --&gt; STDIO[\"StdioServerTransport\"]\n    TRANSPORT --&gt; HTTP[\"Streamable HTTP Transport\"]\n    TOOLS --&gt; T1[\"readFile\"]\n    TOOLS --&gt; T2[\"writeFile\"]\n    TOOLS --&gt; T3[\"listFiles\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"项目初始化\">项目初始化</h2><p>创建一个文件系统 MCP Server 项目：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"mkdir mcp-fs-server &amp;&amp; cd mcp-fs-server&#10;npm init -y&#10;npm install @modelcontextprotocol/sdk zod&#10;npm install -D typescript @types/node&#10;npx tsc --init --target ES2022 --module NodeNext --moduleResolution NodeNext --outDir dist\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mkdir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mcp-fs-server</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mcp-fs-server</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -y</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @modelcontextprotocol/sdk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> zod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -D</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> typescript</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @types/node</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tsc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --init</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ES2022</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --module</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> NodeNext</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --moduleResolution</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> NodeNext</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --outDir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dist</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 <code>package.json</code> 中配置入口：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;mcp-fs-server&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;1.0.0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;module&quot;,&#10;  &quot;bin&quot;: { &quot;mcp-fs-server&quot;: &quot;./dist/index.js&quot; },&#10;  &quot;scripts&quot;: { &quot;build&quot;: &quot;tsc&quot;, &quot;start&quot;: &quot;node dist/index.js&quot; }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mcp-fs-server\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.0.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"module\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"bin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"mcp-fs-server\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/index.js\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scripts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tsc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"start\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"node dist/index.js\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"注册工具\">注册工具</h2><p>使用 <code>server.tool()</code> 方法注册工具。每个工具需要名称、描述、参数 Schema 和执行函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { McpServer } from &#39;@modelcontextprotocol/sdk/server/mcp.js&#39;;&#10;import { z } from &#39;zod&#39;;&#10;import { readFile, writeFile, readdir } from &#39;fs/promises&#39;;&#10;import { resolve } from &#39;path&#39;;&#10;&#10;const BASE_DIR = resolve(process.env.MCP_BASE_DIR ?? process.cwd());&#10;const server = new McpServer({ name: &#39;fs-server&#39;, version: &#39;1.0.0&#39; });&#10;&#10;function safePath(inputPath: string): string {&#10;  const resolved = resolve(BASE_DIR, inputPath);&#10;  if (!resolved.startsWith(BASE_DIR)) {&#10;    throw new Error(`路径越界: ${inputPath}`);&#10;  }&#10;  return resolved;&#10;}&#10;&#10;server.tool(&#39;readFile&#39;, &#39;读取指定路径的文件内容&#39;, { path: z.string().describe(&#39;文件的相对路径&#39;) }, async ({ path }) =&gt; {&#10;  const content = await readFile(safePath(path), &#39;utf-8&#39;);&#10;  return { content: [{ type: &#39;text&#39;, text: content }] };&#10;});&#10;&#10;server.tool(&#10;  &#39;writeFile&#39;,&#10;  &#39;将内容写入指定路径的文件&#39;,&#10;  {&#10;    path: z.string().describe(&#39;文件的相对路径&#39;),&#10;    content: z.string().describe(&#39;要写入的文件内容&#39;),&#10;  },&#10;  async ({ path, content }) =&gt; {&#10;    await writeFile(safePath(path), content, &#39;utf-8&#39;);&#10;    return { content: [{ type: &#39;text&#39;, text: `已写入 ${path}` }] };&#10;  },&#10;);&#10;&#10;server.tool(&#10;  &#39;listFiles&#39;,&#10;  &#39;列出指定目录下的文件和子目录&#39;,&#10;  { path: z.string().default(&#39;.&#39;).describe(&#39;目录的相对路径&#39;) },&#10;  async ({ path: dirPath }) =&gt; {&#10;    const entries = await readdir(safePath(dirPath), { withFileTypes: true });&#10;    const items = entries.map((e) =&gt; ({&#10;      name: e.name,&#10;      type: e.isDirectory() ? &#39;directory&#39; : &#39;file&#39;,&#10;    }));&#10;    return { content: [{ type: &#39;text&#39;, text: JSON.stringify(items, null, 2) }] };&#10;  },&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { McpServer } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@modelcontextprotocol/sdk/server/mcp.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { z } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'zod'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { readFile, writeFile, readdir } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'fs/promises'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { resolve } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'path'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> BASE_DIR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">MCP_BASE_DIR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ??</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> process.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cwd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> server</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> McpServer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'fs-server'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, version: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1.0.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> safePath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">inputPath</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> resolved</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">BASE_DIR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, i