i-dark:#9ECBFF\">'[fs-server] MCP Server 已启动（stdio 模式）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(console.error);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Streamable HTTP 模式（无状态部署，单一 <code>/mcp</code> 端点）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { createServer } from &#39;node:http&#39;;&#10;import { StreamableHTTPServerTransport } from &#39;@modelcontextprotocol/sdk/server/streamableHttp.js&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 无状态模式：sessionIdGenerator 为 undefined，每个请求独立处理，&#10;// 便于水平扩展；有状态会话则由 SDK 自动管理 Mcp-Session-Id。&#10;const httpServer = createServer(async (req, res) =&gt; {&#10;  const transport = new StreamableHTTPServerTransport({&#10;    sessionIdGenerator: undefined,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  res.on(&#39;close&#39;, () =&gt; transport.close());&#10;&#10;  try {&#10;    await server.connect(transport);&#10;    await transport.handleRequest(req, res);&#10;  } catch (error) {&#10;    console.error(&#39;[fs-server] 处理 MCP 请求失败:&#39;, error);&#10;    if (!res.headersSent) {&#10;      res.writeHead(500).end();&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;});&#10;&#10;httpServer.listen(3001, () =&gt; console.error(&#39;[fs-server] Streamable HTTP 已监听 :3001/mcp&#39;));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createServer } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'node:http'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { StreamableHTTPServerTransport } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@modelcontextprotocol/sdk/server/streamableHttp.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 无状态模式：sessionIdGenerator 为 undefined，每个请求独立处理，</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 便于水平扩展；有状态会话则由 SDK 自动管理 Mcp-Session-Id。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> httpServer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createServer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">res</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> transport</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StreamableHTTPServerTransport</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sessionIdGenerator: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">undefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  res.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'close'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transport.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> server.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">connect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(transport);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transport.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handleRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(req, res);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (error) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'[fs-server] 处理 MCP 请求失败:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, error);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">res.headersSent) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      res.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">writeHead</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">httpServer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">listen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3001</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'[fs-server] Streamable HTTP 已监听 :3001/mcp'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p>生产环境跨网络暴露时，必须在 <code>/mcp</code> 前面加 OAuth 2.1 资源服务器鉴权（校验 <code>Authorization: Bearer</code> 访问令牌），并只走 HTTPS。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"测试-server\">测试 Server</h2><p>使用 MCP Inspector 工具验证 Server 是否正常工作：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm run build&#10;npx @modelcontextprotocol/inspector node dist/index.js\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @modelcontextprotocol/inspector</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> node</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dist/index.js</span></span></code></pre></div><p>也可以在 Claude Desktop 或 Cursor 的配置文件中直接注册：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;fs-server&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;node&quot;,&#10;      &quot;args&quot;: [&quot;/path/to/mcp-fs-server/dist/index.js&quot;],&#10;      &quot;env&quot;: { &quot;MCP_BASE_DIR&quot;: &quot;/path/to/workspace&quot; }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"mcpServers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"fs-server\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"command\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"node\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"args\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/path/to/mcp-fs-server/dist/index.js\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"env\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"MCP_BASE_DIR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/path/to/workspace\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"反模式\">反模式</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>为什么错</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>远程 Server 继续使用已废弃的 HTTP+SSE 双端点传输</td>\n<td>新版 Client 逐步移除兼容，且双连接难以水平扩展与恢复</td>\n<td>迁移到 Streamable HTTP 单端点 + <code>Mcp-Session-Id</code> 会话管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨网络暴露 <code>/mcp</code> 却不做鉴权</td>\n<td>任何人都能调用你的工具、读你的资源</td>\n<td>OAuth 2.1 资源服务器模型校验 Bearer token，全程 HTTPS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具描述写得含糊（&quot;处理数据&quot;）</td>\n<td>模型靠 description 决定何时调用，含糊会导致误调用或漏调用</td>\n<td>描述写清输入输出与副作用边界，用 zod <code>.describe()</code> 注明每个参数含义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件类工具不做路径沙箱</td>\n<td><code>../../etc/passwd</code> 一类路径遍历直接穿透</td>\n<td>入口统一做 <code>safePath</code> 解析 + 前缀校验（如本节示例）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>MCP Server 通过 <code>@modelcontextprotocol/sdk</code> 的 McpServer 类创建，自动处理协议握手和能力协商。</li>\n<li>使用 <code>server.tool()</code> 注册工具，每个工具包含名称、描述、zod 参数 Schema 和异步执行函数。</li>\n<li>使用 <code>server.resource()</code> 暴露只读数据资源，Client 通过 URI 访问。</li>\n<li>传输层支持 StdioServerTransport（本地进程）和 StreamableHTTPServerTransport（远程 HTTP，旧版 SSE 传输已废弃）。</li>\n<li>远程暴露必须加 OAuth 2.1 鉴权与 HTTPS，不要用自造 API Key 方案替代标准授权流程。</li>\n<li>路径安全校验（<code>safePath</code>）是文件系统 Server 的必要防护，防止路径遍历攻击。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"实现 MCP Server","id":"实现-mcp-server"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Server 架构概览","id":"server-架构概览"},{"level":2,"text":"项目初始化","id":"项目初始化"},{"level":2,"text":"注册工具","id":"注册工具"},{"level":2,"text":"暴露资源","id":"暴露资源"},{"level":2,"text":"连接传输层","id":"连接传输层"},{"level":2,"text":"测试 Server","id":"测试-server"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式","id":"反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"MCP 规范解读","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-handbook/mcp-protocol/mcp-specification"},"next":{"title":"实现 MCP Client","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-handbook/mcp-protocol/mcp-client"}}